Grammar

    0 $accept: input $end

    1 input: ε
    2      | input line

    3 line: EOL
    4     | expr EOL

    5 expr: literalRealTK
    6     | expr PLUS expr
    7     | expr MINUS expr
    8     | expr MULT expr
    9     | expr DIV expr


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    literalRealTK (258) 5
    PLUS (259) 6
    MINUS (260) 7
    MULT (261) 8
    DIV (262) 9
    EOL (263) 3 4


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (9)
        on left: 0
    input (10)
        on left: 1 2
        on right: 0 2
    line (11)
        on left: 3 4
        on right: 2
    expr (12)
        on left: 5 6 7 8 9
        on right: 4 6 7 8 9


State 0

    0 $accept: • input $end

    $default  reduce using rule 1 (input)

    input  go to state 1


State 1

    0 $accept: input • $end
    2 input: input • line

    $end           shift, and go to state 2
    literalRealTK  shift, and go to state 3
    EOL            shift, and go to state 4

    line  go to state 5
    expr  go to state 6


State 2

    0 $accept: input $end •

    $default  accept


State 3

    5 expr: literalRealTK •

    $default  reduce using rule 5 (expr)


State 4

    3 line: EOL •

    $default  reduce using rule 3 (line)


State 5

    2 input: input line •

    $default  reduce using rule 2 (input)


State 6

    4 line: expr • EOL
    6 expr: expr • PLUS expr
    7     | expr • MINUS expr
    8     | expr • MULT expr
    9     | expr • DIV expr

    PLUS   shift, and go to state 7
    MINUS  shift, and go to state 8
    MULT   shift, and go to state 9
    DIV    shift, and go to state 10
    EOL    shift, and go to state 11


State 7

    6 expr: expr PLUS • expr

    literalRealTK  shift, and go to state 3

    expr  go to state 12


State 8

    7 expr: expr MINUS • expr

    literalRealTK  shift, and go to state 3

    expr  go to state 13


State 9

    8 expr: expr MULT • expr

    literalRealTK  shift, and go to state 3

    expr  go to state 14


State 10

    9 expr: expr DIV • expr

    literalRealTK  shift, and go to state 3

    expr  go to state 15


State 11

    4 line: expr EOL •

    $default  reduce using rule 4 (line)


State 12

    6 expr: expr • PLUS expr
    6     | expr PLUS expr •
    7     | expr • MINUS expr
    8     | expr • MULT expr
    9     | expr • DIV expr

    MULT  shift, and go to state 9
    DIV   shift, and go to state 10

    $default  reduce using rule 6 (expr)


State 13

    6 expr: expr • PLUS expr
    7     | expr • MINUS expr
    7     | expr MINUS expr •
    8     | expr • MULT expr
    9     | expr • DIV expr

    MULT  shift, and go to state 9
    DIV   shift, and go to state 10

    $default  reduce using rule 7 (expr)


State 14

    6 expr: expr • PLUS expr
    7     | expr • MINUS expr
    8     | expr • MULT expr
    8     | expr MULT expr •
    9     | expr • DIV expr

    $default  reduce using rule 8 (expr)


State 15

    6 expr: expr • PLUS expr
    7     | expr • MINUS expr
    8     | expr • MULT expr
    9     | expr • DIV expr
    9     | expr DIV expr •

    $default  reduce using rule 9 (expr)
